# =====================================================================
# LIGHTWEIGHT CALLER + CELL PSAP CROSSCHECK MAP
# =====================================================================
#
# Designed to handle substantially more calls than the previous map.
#
# SHOWS ONLY:
#   1. Caller locations
#   2. Cell locations
#   3. Routed PSAP boundaries
#   4. Caller-derived Expected PSAP boundaries
#   5. Caller <-> Cell geodesic distance
#   6. Caller -> nearest Routed PSAP boundary
#   7. Caller -> nearest Expected PSAP boundary
#
# PERFORMANCE DESIGN
# ------------------
# Instead of creating hundreds/thousands of separate Folium PolyLine
# and Marker objects, this code builds:
#
#   - one Caller GeoJSON layer
#   - one Cell GeoJSON layer
#   - one Caller->Cell GeoJSON layer
#   - one Caller->Routed GeoJSON layer
#   - one Caller->Expected GeoJSON layer
#   - one Routed boundary GeoJSON layer
#   - one Expected boundary GeoJSON layer
#
# This is much lighter in the browser.
#
# No ESPOSREQ.
# No uncertainty.
# No MIN/MEAN/MAX markers.
# No automatic fit_bounds().
#
# =====================================================================

